	spec: 'config.ason composerDebug (boolean, default false, listed by /config, sent to the page) turns on a web message box probe (src/web/composer-debug.ts). While on, the page shows a small fixed badge with the event count and any anomaly, and records every message box event (beforeinput, input, composition, keys, focus, selection, paste), throttled example changes, size and visual viewport changes, with a snapshot: app.state.text, the box value and selection, the example (classes, cut, text, geometry, font, column width), box/field/attach/action button geometry, viewport and device pixel ratio. Anomalies: box value differs from app.state.text; the example drawn under typed text; example and box fonts or column widths differ. A 1 s poll records persisting anomalies. Batches of at most 100 rows POST to /composer-debug (logged-in, same-origin, only while the setting is on, under 4 MB); the host appends one JSON line per row to state/composer-debug.log, rotating to .1 past 16 MB. It records draft text, so it stays off unless the user opts in. Diagnoses the invariant that the example never draws under typed text and the box shows app.state.text.',
